  "title": "Dry Brine Turkey",
  "description": "This dry brine turkey recipe uses a simple salt rub to get a perfectly seasoned, juicy turkey with crispy skin. An easy get-ahead method for Thanksgiving.",
  "authors": [
    "hello angie"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T03:05:38-04:00",
