  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "1 (15 pound) whole turkey, neck and giblets removed",
    "3 tablespoons kosher salt",
    "black pepper to taste",
    "1 onion, cut into wedges",
    "4 stalks celery, halved"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GgoX6pfouDcBiw7FFPo32GPFBS4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245524-dry-brine-turkey-VAT-step-01-331e7b67441e4aae8bae3522d00eb4f0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245524/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pat turkey dry with paper towels. Season inside and outside of turkey with kosher salt, focusing on breast and thighs. Place turkey, breast-side up, in the roasting pan and cover with plastic wrap. Refrigerate turkey for about 2 days.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qcnSGeKX4b26xi8vJqeSShFOiio=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245524-dry-brine-turkey-VAT-step-02-6468e40d18524b4a80a3febd522bcb86.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245524/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Flip turkey breast-side down, cover with plastic wrap, and refrigerate for about 1 more day.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/E6xlhiYNFHu5dIKi4KzV7arlU-Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245524-dry-brine-turkey-VAT-step-03-9eac86481e4a4fcfb37125d12e9f3474.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245524/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove plastic wrap and place turkey on a rack over a baking sheet the night before you plan to roast. Allow turkey to air-dry in the refrigerator for at least 8 hours. This step helps the skin crisp beautifully during roasting.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JQIJDI1p4CChIiqmjX3Jp-lt3Cw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245524-dry-brine-turkey-VAT-step-04-26bf9d86d87c4fdeac7463064ace0b7a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245524/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring turkey to room temperature, 1 to 2 hours; pat dry with paper towels. Season turkey with black pepper and place onion and celery in the cavity.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zn_cWiv73vW4XTJQrkTH_erZvQQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245524-dry-brine-turkey-VAT-step-05-4a2591a7e4214fb3b2647be1fb40c17a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245524/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Place turkey, breast-side down, in a roasting pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/17KVtnYN1cxeykEOMVS3xCuVUy0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245524-dry-brine-turkey-VAT-step-06-7f49615c09e843ab8b467b3c562c633b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245524/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast in the preheated oven until skin is golden, about 30 minutes. Remove turkey from oven and flip to breast-side up. Reduce oven temperature to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C); continue roasting until an instant-read thermometer inserted into the thickest part of the thigh reads 165 degrees F (74 degrees C), about 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fRqbVHVqnjofAA0eLD47KKy4Ysc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245524-dry-brine-turkey-VAT-step-07-3edbec8bb42f481b90ed1fae36a3f6f2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245524/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer turkey to a large platter and loosely tent with aluminum foil; allow turkey to rest about 30 minutes before carving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jnu5S-hKo_aoVaB624mmfr4b-tU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/245524-dry-brine-turkey-VAT-step-08-0055b4a4063a4730a578a80c05a6acf4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/245524/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
